      "role": "user",
      "content": "fair enough. but some people say the \"choice\" is kind of a myth because most vouchers only cover a fraction of private tuition, so it's really just helping wealthy families while draining the public pool. does it feel like the pro-voucher side is just ignoring those facts to push their agenda?",
